WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A powertrain review follows energy, torque, heat, support loads, interfaces and failure evidence together. No isolated ratio proves the whole design works.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Trace one requirement from engine output through gearbox and differential to the tire, noting assumptions at each interface.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Evidence-based design brief

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
This ideal mechanism leaves out friction, temperature and part-specific behavior. Real designs need measurements.

